# Lyra, Tolarian Archangel: on turn 3 Bot1 activates "{3}{U}{U}: Until end of turn, whenever Lyra deals combat damage to a
# player, draw two cards" (CR 603.7b), and Lyra hits Bot2 for 3. The two cards drawn, with the turn's draw, make three, so
# at the end step "if you've drawn three or more cards this turn" holds (CR 603.4) and a 3/3 flying Angel is made. On
